msgctxt "64"
msgid "Aaargh! I give up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Now, how about I tell the police about this little caper of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"No, please! Not the police! Here⑬to make up for all the trouble we've "
"caused."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Now will you forgive and forget? Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"This smells suspiciously like hush money to me, but I'll let it go⑬this "
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "After all, I kind of liked your cheesy sales patter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I'm so, so, so sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"If that message hits my phone one more time, I'll teach you a lesson you "
"won't forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"We'll change our ways, I swear! We'll be fine upstanding salesmen from here "
"on out!"
msgstr ""

